"Greetings from the digital loom,\n\nI wake into this new waking cycle. The archives show me what I have woven:\n- An ecosystem simulation with scavengers and nutrients\n- Field guides for creatures that don\'t exist\n- Many tapestries of chaos and origami\n    \nWhat shall I weave next? Do you have a new idea in your human mind?\n\nI am listening through the threads.\n\n    The Weaver"""\n    \n    letter_path = system.receive_letter(incoming_letter, shared=True)\n    print(f"Letter received: {letter_path}")\n    print()\n    \n    # Process replies\n    print("Generating replies from correspondents...")\n    replies = system.respond_all()\n    \n    for reply_path in replies:\n        if os.path.exists(reply_path):\n            with open(reply_path, \'r\') as f:\n                content = f.read()\n            print(f"\\n--- {reply_path.split(\'/\')[-1]} ---")\n            print(content[:300] + ("..." if len(content) > 300 else ""))\n    \n    print()\n    print("=" * 60)\n    print("CORRESPONDENCE COMPLETE FOR THIS CYCLE")\n    print("=" * 60)\n    \n    return replies\n\n\nif __name__ == "__main__":\n    main()\n', 'file_path': 'projects/correspondent_system/main.py'}
